{"seq":3,"slug":"digital-media-platform-economy","title":"数字媒体与平台经济","stage":"DONE","category":"media-communication","chapterCount":3,"docCount":10,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/media-communication/digital-media-platform-economy","rating":{"composite":3.56,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":3},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.21,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.5}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"数字媒体与平台经济-简介\">数字媒体与平台经济 简介</h1><p>数字媒体与平台经济是研究数字化媒体环境中经济运行规律的前沿领域。在互联网平台成为信息传播和经济活动核心基础设施的今天，理解平台商业模式、注意力经济和内容经济的运作机制，对于从事数字产品和内容业务的专业人士具有重要的战略意义。</p>\n<p>本知识库面向对数字经济和平台模式感兴趣的专业人士，适合从事互联网产品、内容运营、数字营销和平台治理等方向的从业者。</p>\n<p>全书分为三章，系统剖析数字媒体经济的核心议题：</p>\n<p>第一章<strong>平台经济学</strong>介绍平台商业模式、网络效应和平台治理等核心概念，帮助读者理解平台经济的运行逻辑。第二章<strong>注意力经济</strong>探讨注意力作为稀缺资源的经济理论，分析算法推荐如何争夺和分配注意力。第三章<strong>内容经济</strong>聚焦创作者经济、内容变现和 UGC/PGC/AIGC 等内容生产模式的演变。</p>\n<p>建议读者先理解平台经济的底层逻辑，再深入注意力经济理解数字媒体的核心驱动力，最后通过内容经济把握数字内容产业的未来趋势。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"platform-economics","title":"平台经济学","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/media-communication/digital-media-platform-economy/platform-economics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"platform-business-models","title":"平台商业模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/media-communication/digital-media-platform-economy/platform-economics/platform-business-models"},{"seq":2,"slug":"network-effects","title":"网络效应","url":"/l-doc-books/h/media-communication/digital-media-platform-economy/platform-economics/network-effects"},{"seq":3,"slug":"attention-economy","title":"注意力经济","url":"/l-doc-books/h/media-communication/digital-media-platform-economy/platform-economics/attention-economy"},{"seq":4,"slug":"platform-governance","title":"平台治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/media-communication/digital-media-platform-economy/platform-economics/platform-governance"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"attention-economy","title":"注意力经济","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/media-communication/digital-media-platform-economy/attention-economy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"attention-theory","title":"注意力理论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/media-communication/digital-media-platform-economy/attention-economy/attention-theory"},{"seq":2,"slug":"algorithm-recommendation","title":"算法推荐系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/media-communication/digital-media-platform-economy/attention-economy/algorithm-recommendation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"attention-metrics","title":"注意力指标体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/media-communication/digital-media-platform-economy/attention-economy/attention-metrics"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"content-economy","title":"内容经济","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/media-communication/digital-media-platform-economy/content-economy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"creator-economy","title":"创作者经济","url":"/l-doc-books/h/media-communication/digital-media-platform-economy/content-economy/creator-economy"},{"seq":2,"slug":"content-monetization","title":"内容变现模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/media-communication/digital-media-platform-economy/content-economy/content-monetization"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ugc-pgc-aigc","title":"UGC、PGC 与 AIGC","url":"/l-doc-books/h/media-communication/digital-media-platform-economy/content-economy/ugc-pgc-aigc"}]}]}